      "message": "I\u0027m not sure this cmpxchg is not an overkill. We know this is only called during pKVM initialization, when we don\u0027t donate any pages to pVMs yet?\n\nSimilarly, in `pkvm_guest_mmu_setup()`, for example, we have just plain assignments.\n\nTo put it another way, if we are bothering with cmpxchg for setting `iommu_tlb_flush_fn`, why aren\u0027t we bothering with it for setting `pt_domain.qi_batch` (which is checked in `pkvm_intel_iommu_tlb_flush()` every time)?",
